        "chapter": 48,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, and he was a man who was firm in the faith of Christ, and he had sworn with an oath to defend his people, his rights, and his country, and his religion, even to the loss of his blood.",
        "footNotes": [
